{"_id":"SoulBurnFeature1","name":"Soul Burn","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/soul-burn.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You awaken the power of the Luminara and erupt in holy light, pushing beyond mortal limits. You must have an available Hit Die to enter Soul Burn; roll it to determine the duration without expending it. While active, you gain double movement and one free Soul Burn action each turn.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"open\"><i class=\"fas fa-fire\"></i> Enter Soul Burn</button></p><p><strong>This feature requires an available Hit Die.</strong></p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"spec"},"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"activate"}}}
{"_id":"AetherStrikeFeat","name":"AetherSurge","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/aethersurge.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per attack after you hit, burn your vitality to infuse the blow, spell, or projectile with Radiant energy. Spend and roll one Hit Die, then add the result to either the attack roll or the damage roll, but not both.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"surge\"><i class=\"fas fa-burst\"></i> Use AetherSurge</button></p><p>Hit Dice spent this way remain expended until recovered normally.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":"After an attack hits"},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"spec"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"Active Soul Burn","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"surge"}}}
{"_id":"ChannelAetherFt1","name":"Channel Aether","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/channel-aether.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Gather sacred energy and spend one of this feature&apos;s two charges to fire a brilliant beam of holy light at one enemy you can see. Make an attack roll. On a hit, the target takes Radiant damage equal to your Hit Die roll + your level. This does not consume a Hit Die.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"channel\"><i class=\"fas fa-sun\"></i> Channel Aether</button></p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":60,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":2,"max":"2","per":"charges","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"rsak","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"Active Soul Burn","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"channel"}}}
{"_id":"FateShiftFeature","name":"Fate Shift","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/fate-shift.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Declare an action that bends, breaks, or modifies the normal rules of the game. The GM must approve it. This cannot manifest infinite resources or simply wish an enemy dead.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"fate\"><i class=\"fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i> Declare Fate Shift</button></p><p>Once the declaration is made, Soul Burn ends.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"legendary","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":1,"max":"1","per":"charges","recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"Active Soul Burn","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"fate"}}}
{"_id":"AetherglowFeat01","name":"Holy Amulet of Lux Eterna","type":"equipment","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/holy-amulet-lux-eterna.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Given to you by Grand Dad Eldamoor. It represents the Aetherlight and contains what appears to be clear water. When shaken, the water displays a bright luminescence.</p><p>The top of the amulet has a spout which can be opened to allow water to pour.</p><blockquote><p><em>Instantly stabilizes a downed creature</em></p><p><em>Heals 1d20</em></p><p><em>Removes charmed, poisoned, petrified, temporary ability-score reductions, and temporary reductions to maximum hit points</em></p></blockquote><p>The amulet holds 6 charges. When used, choose which player character receives its Aetherglow. Soul Burn recipients also release Soul Burn after AG Tolerance is applied.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"glow\"><i class=\"fas fa-flask\"></i> Pour Aetherglow</button></p><p><em>Every exposure increases AG Tolerance by 1, to a maximum of 19.</em></p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Eldamoor","quantity":1,"weight":1,"price":{"value":230,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":0,"equipped":false,"rarity":"legendary","identified":true,"activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":6,"max":"6","per":"charges","recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"armor":{"value":null,"type":"trinket","dex":null},"strength":0,"stealth":false,"proficient":true,"ability":"","actionType":"heal","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"glow"}}}
